# keeps the `replace` to the sibling checkout for now — pinning a
# pseudo-version of a pre-merge branch SHA would bake a PR-branch revision
# into the module graph. Swap the directive for a normal `require` (and
# re-pin to the merge-result SHA) once the branch lands on main.
